  "_comment": "PCG point Set/Kind -> prefab (Unity twin of ue5/Config/asset_map.json, same keys, test-enforced). Empty prefab = skipped. 'prefabs' (list) picks one per row by Variant. scale multiplies the CSV Scale on the axes in scale_axes. yaw_offset_deg turns the prefab so its forward matches the point yaw: the runtime assumes the model faces +X; a glTF model imported by glTFast that faces glTF +X ends up facing Unity -X, so such a prefab needs 180 (check on the first import, docs/13-tich-hop-unity.md §6).",
